10. Phosphorus is not selected merely because its accounting is cleaner; the first case must test the architecture’s difficult epistemic/institutional layers.
11. Publication-count proposals are not treated as votes; source independence and method decide.
12. Article 012 numerical verification is accepted at source-stated status as instructed, but open classifications remain open.

