## Final joint judgment

The reviews strongly support continuing the general-theory programme, but with a narrower sequence of proof obligations. The immediate mathematical bottleneck is the viability/invariance/strategy hierarchy, not the absence of additional concepts. Once that hierarchy is canonicalized, most Article 001 corrections become local, Article 002 can serve as the restricted theorem spine, and the project can prove one transformation theorem and one composition theorem without overclaiming generality. Groundwater should then test whether the architecture can survive partial observation and institutional constraints; phosphorus should test accounting and cross-scale composition. Article 012 remains the strongest independent applied paper, and Article 011 remains the leading conditional empirical paper.
